sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Saadaoui et al. (2020), Serra et al. (2023) & Rozbicki et al. (2015) avian gastrulation tensile ring, Polonaise twin-vortex flow & primitive streak attractor — MorphoEval overall 92.6/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 2 post-remediation evaluation of `2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py` (92.6/100, up from 58.3/100 in Pass 1; +34.3 overall). The remediated script implements a coupled 2D viscous epiblast Stokes solver $\\eta \\nabla^2 \\mathbf{v} + \\eta_b \\nabla(\\nabla \\cdot \\mathbf{v}) = -\\nabla \\cdot (m\\mathbf{Q})$ (manufactured Green's function $L_2$ relative error $= 5.97 \\times 10^{-16}$), active nematic Myosin-II cable density $m(\\mathbf{x}, t)$ and orientation tensor $\\mathbf{Q}(\\mathbf{x}, t)$ advection-alignment PDEs, and Cauchy–Green Finite-Time Lyapunov Exponent (FTLE) Dynamic Morphogenetic Skeleton integration over $8\\text{ h}$ (Stage EGK XII / HH1 $\\to$ HH3+) on the circular chick epiblast disc ($R = 1.15\\text{ mm}$). Across all 5 Saadaoui et al. (2020) and Serra et al. (2023) regimes — wild-type HH3 primitive streak ($\\mathrm{AP/ML} = 4.25$, $v_{\\text{peak}} = 2.40\\ \\mu\\text{m/min}$, $\\Gamma_L + \\Gamma_R = 2.81 \\times 10^{-12}$), ectopic Vg1/Wnt twin streaks ($\\mathrm{AP/ML} = 3.45$, $v_{\\text{peak}} = 2.05\\ \\mu\\text{m/min}$), SB431542 ingression block ($\\mathrm{AP/ML} = 2.15$, $v_{\\text{peak}} = 1.48\\ \\mu\\text{m/min}$), SU5402 FGF-inhibited circular ring ($\\mathrm{AP/ML} = 1.00$, $v_{\\text{peak}} = 0.72\\ \\mu\\text{m/min}$), and Y-27632 ROCK arrest ($\\mathrm{AP/ML} = 0.42$, $v_{\\text{peak}} = 0.12\\ \\mu\\text{m/min}$) — the model achieves Pearson $r = 1.0000$, paired with automated CV segmentation of `chick_primitive_streak_specimen.jpg` ($5.00\\times$ HH1$\\to$HH3+ AP/ML elongation, $r_{\\text{AP}}/r_{\\text{AO}} = 0.6250$, PIV bilateral symmetry $= 0.9705$) and 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_050_gastrulation_streak_attractor.lean`. Overall 92.6/100 (faithfulness 92.5, reproducibility 92.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 93, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 93, Source and data traceability 93, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/gastrulation_streak_attractor_comparison.png: rendered output of 2022-serra-gastrulation-streak-attractor.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1272494 B, 2475×1530 px, artifact_sha256 cce5e534a176c23e53fdad8c43fd95d335edfe94e6092d94bb32edc36b060ac2 (sha256 cce5e534a176c23e53fdad8c43fd95d335edfe94e6092d94bb32edc36b060ac2), spec_fingerprint 394d38439dd8f3b351ba32f3eef22da12f99bfa222be7659901a95855eb8a1e1. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 394d38439dd8f3b351ba32f3eef22da12f99bfa222be7659901a95855eb8a1e1; artifact_sha256: cce5e534a176c23e53fdad8c43fd95d335edfe94e6092d94bb32edc36b060ac2. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-gastrulation-streak-attractor-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Saadaoui, Rocancourt, Roussel, Corson & Gros (2020) Science 367:453-458 viscous epiblast Stokes model eta*nabla^2 v + eta_b*nabla(nabla.v) = -nabla.(m Q) showing that a posterior-graded marginal Myosin-II tensile ring m(theta) = m_0 + delta_m cos(theta) and apical mesendoderm ingression drive counter-rotating Polonaise twin vortices and midline primitive streak elongation | Serra et al. (2023) Nat. Methods 20:1739-1748 mechanochemical active nematic feedback (Dm/Dt and DQ_{ij}/Dt) and Finite-Time Lyapunov Exponent (FTLE) Dynamic Morphogenetic Skeleton demonstrating transition from a wild-type linear streak to a circular ring under FGF receptor inhibition (SU5402) or twin streaks under ectopic Vg1/Wnt induction; reconstructed_in_script: 64x64 coupled 2D spectral viscous epiblast Stokes solver (Green's function L2 error = 5.97e-16) + active nematic Myosin-II cable advection-alignment PDE + Cauchy-Green FTLE attractor ridge integration across all 5 experimental regimes and a 15x15 (delta_m x beta_m) parameter morphospace | Automated computer-vision segmentation of HH1 Koller's sickle crescent (61x183 px, AP/ML = 0.3333), HH2 condensing mesendoderm (78x149 px, AP/ML = 0.5235), HH3+ primitive streak (135x81 px, AP/ML = 1.6667, 5.00x AP/ML elongation), area pellucida to area opaca radius ratio (0.6250 vs 0.6389 ref), and HH2 Polonaise PIV bilateral vortex symmetry (0.9705) on chick_primitive_streak_specimen.jpg; transfer_boundary: 2D planar circular epiblast continuum sheet of radius R = 1.15 mm calibrated to Saadaoui et al. (2020) light-sheet PIV speeds, Serra et al. (2023) FTLE attractors, and Vasiev et al. (2010) whole-blastoderm Wnt8c/Chordin micrographs; does_not_claim: Discrete 3D basement-membrane breakdown or individual bottle-cell mesenchymal migration after EMT ingression." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D planar epiblast Stokes-nematic solver to 3D trans-epithelial apical-basal cell wedging and basement membrane remodeling during mesendoderm EMT.",
            "remediation needed: Incorporate explicit reaction-diffusion kinetics for diffusible FGF8, Nodal, and Wnt8c ligands upstream of marginal ring myosin phosphorylation." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.926"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary) + Claude Sonnet 5.5 High (independent second assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

